QuotientGroup__map : (N : Elem (Subgroup G)) -> (M : Elem (Subgroup H)) -> (f : Elem (MonoidHom G H)) -> (h1 : Proof (Leq N (Subgroup__comap f M))) -> Elem (MonoidHom (HasQuotient__Quotient G N) (HasQuotient__Quotient H M)).

(; doc: The canonical map from a group `α` to the quotient `α ⧸ s`. ;)
(; //LEAN:QuotientGroup.mk ;)
QuotientGroup__mk : (a : Elem X) -> Elem (HasQuotient__Quotient X s).

